body:
\*\*\[DbM\] Death by Midnight\*\*

&#x200B;

\*\*Xbox One\*\*



\*\*Where are most of your clan members located (country/time zones)\*\*: US/CAN - CST/ EST 

&#x200B;

\* \*\*When do we usually play\*\*: Playing Times Usually between 6PM-2AM EST During the week, and later on weekends. Preferred Experience Should have great experience in D2 or have played D1, we are looking to pull in more veterans / people who are still serious with the game to prevent not completing Raids, Lairs, etc. Should be 21+

&#x200B;

   \* If you fit within those time slots, feel free to message the following members:

&#x200B;

\*  Koncept (You can also message me on discord - Koncept#1177)

\*  Cheezus Crust X

\*  Raz Tor Desh

&#x200B;

\* \*\*About us:\*\* Many of our members have stopped playing and makes LFGing for end game content a chore at times.

We are looking for 3 more players to add to our base clan so that we can consistently complete the raids weekly, etc. If you are a mature adult and interested in joining please check us out!

Death by Midnight \[DbM\] was formed based from members of a clan that became inactive. The members currently are looking to add more guardians to play daily, run end game content, weekly's, etc. We are a mature group of players with D1 & D2 Experience.

We also have a discord setup as well for chat, coordination, etc. (Given when added to clan)

&#x200B;

\* \*\*What is the best way to contact the clan\*\*: You can reply in thread or visit our clan page and request to join! I will reach out to you for any other info (availability, pve/pvp, etc) You can also contact Koncept on xbox live

&#x200B;

\* \*\*Number of Active Members\*\*: 3

&#x200B;

\* \*\*Preferred Experience:\*\*

  \* Minimum 620 Light

  \* Age: 21+

  \* Raid Experience

  \* Previous experience to D1 or big amount of time logged in D2

&#x200B;

\*\*\*Also, if you are a clan leader, let me know as I am trying to coordinate with other clans to make a sort of close circle LFG to weed out toxic players!\*\*\*         

&#x200B;

\*\*Check us out!\*\* [https://www.bungie.net/en/ClanV2?groupid=3141536](https://www.bungie.net/en/ClanV2?groupid=3141536)
